Basic Usage Configuration
Configure Management Network
Connect the monitor directly to the device and log in with the admin account for configuration.
Default account and password: 
admin/NDR1234!@#$
Or
admin/Admin1234!

Configure Network
Login the Web Management HomePage
In the browser address bar, enter https://<appliance_IP_address> to login the Web Management HomePage.

Activate Product License
The System can only detect traffic and update signature databases after being activated with a license file.
SystemManagement > System Information
Import License File

Set up a Monitoring Port
At least one interface must be set as a monitoring port to observe network traffic.
1. SystemManagement > Network Settings > Interface Settings.
2. In the Edit Interface dialog box, set the Interface Type to Monitoring Port.

Upgrade
Version Upgrade
 please go to SystemManagement  > Version Upgrade 

Pattern Library Upgrade
Online Update
Go to SystemManagement  > Pattern Library Upgrade
